+  verification evidence, not evidence that tests were red.
+- **Act 9 host/CI clarification:** effective as an audit distinction — every current host-policy
+  finding separates managed-agent execution from permitted GitHub-hosted CI; no workflow was
+  disabled on this basis in the sampled cases.
+
+## 9. Referrals (no Judicial reform proposal)
+
+- To the **Executive / operator machinery owner**: investigate and repair the unbounded
+  `suite-status.sh` wait under `internal.lock` with a bounded, fail-closed timeout and a hermetic
+  regression test; keep the original case open until independently verified. Owner acts under
+  existing authority; Judiciary does not implement it.
+- To **Parliament**: consider the evidence in §§1–8 and decide whether any legal change is
+  warranted. Judiciary submits no bill, no ratification and no measurement-system change.
